IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `esba-board`

-- Enterprise Singapore Board Act 2018, ss 8(2), 11(2), 18, 20, 22(3), 23, 25, 34, 35, 46 to 52 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_enterprise-singapore-board-act-2018.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`an ordinary business leader` MEANS Candidate WITH
